<title>VENEZUELA: Manpa Q1 net rises to 2.24 bln bolivars.</title>
<headline>Manpa Q1 net rises to 2.24 bln bolivars.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net 2.239 billion bolivars vs 2.229 billion bolivars</p>
<p>Revs 19.924 billion bolivars vs 27.345 billion bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Period ending 31 March, 1997.</p>
<p>Results are inflation-adjusted.</p>
<p>Manufacturas de Papel SA is a paper and pulp manufacturer.</p>
<p>It recently signed a joint venture agreement with Canada's Tolko Co to build two sawmills in Venezuela for $120 million</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600)</p>
